=== unit-514 post-hoc — which conjunct fires, and is the equality one reached? ===

  host sha12 e3354aeb3d63

  P6.d as written in the frozen host:
      'P6.d  `tracked files read` is the ONLY named figure that moved':
      movedFigures.length === 1 && movedFigures[0] === 'tracked files read',
  P6.e as written in the frozen host:
      'P6.e  `tracked files read` is the ONLY line that differs, pre to post':
      firstToLast.onlyInFirst.length === 1 && firstToLast.onlyInSecond.length === 1
      && firstToLast.onlyInFirst[0].includes('tracked files read')
      && firstToLast.onlyInSecond[0].includes('tracked files read'),

  VERBATIM  P6.d  COUNT     true                             movedFigures.length === 1
  VERBATIM  P6.d  EQUALITY  true                             movedFigures[0] === 'tracked files read'
  RENAMED   P6.d  COUNT     FALSE — this is the one that fires movedFigures.length === 1
  RENAMED   P6.d  EQUALITY  NOT REACHED (short-circuited)    movedFigures[0] === 'tracked files read'
  VERBATIM  P6.e  COUNT     true                             firstToLast.onlyInFirst.length === 1
  VERBATIM  P6.e  COUNT     true                             firstToLast.onlyInSecond.length === 1
  VERBATIM  P6.e  INCLUDES  true                             firstToLast.onlyInFirst[0].includes('tracked files read')
  VERBATIM  P6.e  INCLUDES  true                             firstToLast.onlyInSecond[0].includes('tracked files read')
  RENAMED   P6.e  COUNT     true                             firstToLast.onlyInFirst.length === 1
  RENAMED   P6.e  COUNT     true                             firstToLast.onlyInSecond.length === 1
  RENAMED   P6.e  INCLUDES  FALSE — this is the one that fires firstToLast.onlyInFirst[0].includes('tracked files read')
  RENAMED   P6.e  INCLUDES  NOT REACHED (short-circuited)    firstToLast.onlyInSecond[0].includes('tracked files read')

  SUMMARY
    conjuncts that fire under the rename: [{"verdict":"P6.d","kind":"COUNT","conjunct":"movedFigures.length === 1"},{"verdict":"P6.e","kind":"INCLUDES","conjunct":"firstToLast.onlyInFirst[0].includes('tracked files read')"}]
    never reached under the rename:       [{"verdict":"P6.d","kind":"EQUALITY","conjunct":"movedFigures[0] === 'tracked files read'"},{"verdict":"P6.e","kind":"INCLUDES","conjunct":"firstToLast.onlyInSecond[0].includes('tracked files read')"}]
    EQUALITY conjuncts reached: 0 of 1
    INCLUDES conjuncts that fired: 1   COUNT conjuncts that fired: 1

